# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Durability policy (see docs/DURABILITY.md)
#
#   IGNORED  : the SQLite binary and its WAL sidecars, local backups
#   COMMITTED: data/journal/*.jsonl  (append-only write journal)
#              data/export/*.json    (canonical full exports)
#
# The database is a derived artifact. The journal and the exports are the
# asset. Never invert this.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

gate.db
gate.db-wal
gate.db-shm
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

data/backups/

node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
coverage/

.DS_Store
*.local
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Locally-owned PDFs referenced by questions.local_pdf_path are never committed.
data/pdf/
